
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="vi">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Profile - Thanh Hương</title>

<style>
* {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
}

body {
    min-height: 100vh;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffd6e7, #dcd6ff);
    padding: 20px;
}

.profile {
    width: 350px;
    background: white;
    padding: 30px;
    border-radius: 25px;
    text-align: center;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 30px #0002;
    animation: fadeIn 1s ease;
}

@keyframes fadeIn {
    from {
        opacity: 0;
        transform: translateY(30px);
    }
    to {
        opacity: 1;
        transform: translateY(0);
    }
}

.avatar {
    width: 120px;
    height: 120px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    object-fit: cover;
    border: 5px solid #ffc1dc;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
}

h1 {
    color: #d65c91;
    font-size: 24px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
}

.subtitle {
    color: #999;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
}

.info {
    background: #fff1f7;
    padding: 15px;
    border-radius: 15px;
    text-align: left;
    line-height: 2.2;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    color: #555;
}

h3 {
    color: #d65c91;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
}

.hobbies {
    margin-bottom: 20px;
}

.hobbies span {
    display: inline-block;
    background: #ffe1ee;
    color: #bd5682;
    padding: 8px 12px;
    border-radius: 20px;
    margin: 4px;
    font-size: 13px;
}

button {
    border: none;
    background: #e879a8;
    color: white;
    padding: 12px 25px;
    border-radius: 25px;
    cursor: pointer;
    font-size: 15px;
    transition: 0.3s;
}

button:hover {
    background: #c94f86;
    transform: scale(1.05);
}

footer {
    color: #aaa;
    font-size: 12px;
    margin-top: 20px;
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="profile">

    <img class="avatar"
    src="https://i.pravatar.cc/300"
    alt="Ảnh đại diện">

    <h1>Nguyễn Thị Thanh Hương</h1>
    <p class="subtitle">✨ Welcome to my profile ✨</p>

    <div class="info">
        <h3>Thông tin cá nhân</h3>
        <p>🎂 Ngày sinh: 11/09/2009</p>
        <p>🎓 Lớp: 12C4</p>
        <p>🏫 Nghề nghiệp: Học sinh</p>
        <p>🌍 Quốc gia: Việt Nam</p>
    </div>

    <div class="hobbies">
        <h3>💗 Sở thích</h3>
        <span>🎧 Nghe nhạc</span>
        <span>📸 Chụp ảnh</span>
        <span>✈️ Du lịch</span>
        <span>🍰 Ăn uống</span>
    </div>

    <button onclick="alert('Cảm ơn bạn đã ghé thăm Profile của Hương! 💗')">
        Say Hello 💌
    </button>

    <footer>
        © 2026 | Made with 💗 by Thanh Hương
    </footer>

</div>

</body>
</html>
